BILL OF MATERIALS
Project: Alarmclock.ca
Repository: https://github.com/spacedivee/alarmclock.ca
Revision: 1.0
Date: 2026-10-30

This BOM is based on the hardware and quantities listed in the project's README.
Prices and manufacturer part numbers are not included because they are not specified
in the repository. Confirm all quantities against the final assembled build.

ITEMS
-----
Item: Seeed XIAO ESP32C3
Description: Main microcontroller
Quantity: 1
Source: BLARE kit

Item: 2.25-inch ST7789 TFT display
Description: Clock display
Quantity: 1
Source: BLARE kit

Item: 3.3 V piezo buzzer
Description: Audible alarm output
Quantity: 1
Source: BLARE kit

Item: MX-style keyboard switch
Description: User input switch
Quantity: 4
Source: BLARE kit

Item: White DSA keycap
Description: Keycap for keyboard switch
Quantity: 4
Source: BLARE kit

Item: Display header and jumper wires
Description: Display connection hardware
Quantity: 1 set
Source: BLARE kit

Item: Rotary encoder
Description: User input / navigation
Quantity: 1
Source: User supplied

Item: Auxiliary battery pack
Description: Portable power source
Quantity: 1
Source: User supplied

Item: Power switch
Description: Physical power control for auxiliary supply
Quantity: 1
Source: User supplied

Item: Custom PCB
Description: Main circuit board
Quantity: 1
Source: Custom-designed in KiCad

Item: Custom enclosure
Description: Clock housing
Quantity: 1
Source: Custom-designed / 3D printed

NOTES
-----
- The BLARE kit contains additional switches, keycaps, diodes, headers, jumper wires,
  heat-set inserts and screws. This BOM lists the quantities/components identified
  for this project in the repository README; unused kit spares are not counted.
- The auxiliary battery pack and its power switch are listed separately.
- Unit prices, extended prices, vendors and manufacturer part numbers should be added
  if required for purchasing or grant reimbursement.
